PostgreSQL migrations for RoleIntel.

From the repository root, with the API installed and DATABASE_URL configured:

    python -m alembic -c apps\api\alembic.ini upgrade head
    python -m alembic -c apps\api\alembic.ini check

Use Alembic migrations, not Base.metadata.create_all(), to manage application tables.
See the repository README for local configuration and disposable database tests.